": "https://www.kompas.tv/video/493961/tak-asing-dengan-kata-spill-ternyata-inilah-makna-dari-kata-gaul-spill"}]}, "The search didn't turn up a slang (gaul) meaning for \"andilau.\" It returned the standard dictionary entry instead.\n\n- **Dictionary meaning:** According to KBBI Online, andilau is a tall tree with a thick trunk, good for reforestation, whose wood is light and dry. The entry also lists a second, idiomatic sense: a family's honor is touched when one of its members is insulted.\n- **Slang usage:** None of the results describe \"andilau\" as slang. The pages about slang (*bahasa gaul*) cover other words, such as \"well\" and \"spill,\" so they don't help here.\n\nIf you saw \"andilau\" used in a chat or on social media, it may be a regional term, a typo, or a newer expression that isn't indexed yet. Sharing the sentence where you saw it would help me narrow it down."], "durationSeconds": 5.08908325, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01AKjB9GuHXx4pEFMHd2GfAr", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
