{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_016firpFq7uv9M7mqwpMpsQ4", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.fimela.com/lifestyle/read/3733941/dilema-cinta-yang-dialami-seorang-gadis-dalam-pesawat-menyebar-luas-di-dunia-maya\"}, {\"url\": \"https://trykaiwa.com/blog/indonesian-expressing-emotions-feelings-2026\"}, {\"url\": \"https://shopee.co.id/inspirasi-shopee/?p=58817\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.klikdokter.com/psikologi/kesehatan-mental/sering-galau-lakukan-ini-untuk-mengatasinya\"}, {\"url\": \"https://journal.isi.ac.id/index.php/joged/article/download/14162/3921\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ejournal.unuja.ac.id/index.php/mushaf/article/download/7066/pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/2024/04/25/mengenal-padepokan-anti-galau-cirebon-tempat-caleg-stres-cari-ketenangan\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.gramedia.com/best-seller/?p=17668\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/cerita-dari-kawan/komunitas/membangun-kesadaran-quarter-life-crisis-di-kalangan-mahasiswa-bojonegoro-melalui-diskusi-literasi-ormada-2025\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:17:48.915Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"andilau\" antara dilema dan galau", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01F6cFEdefzdPTnPTrWtA9fK", "content": [{"title": "dilema cinta yang dialami seorang gadis dalam pesawat menyebar luas di dunia maya", "url": "https://www.fimela.com/lifestyle/read/3733941/dilema-cinta-yang-dialami-seorang-gadis-dalam-pesawat-menyebar-luas-di-dunia-maya"}, {"title": "indonesian expressing emotions feelings 2026", "url": "https://trykaiwa.com/blog/indonesian-expressing-emotions-feelings-2026"}, {"title": "Dilema Antara Istri Sah vs Pelakor – Episode 3", "url": "https://shopee.co.id/inspirasi-shopee/?p=58817"}, {"title": "Kesehatan Mental", "url": "https://www.klikdokter.com/psikologi/kesehatan-mental/sering-galau-lakukan-ini-untuk-mengatasinya"}, {"title": "journal.isi.ac.id", "url": "https://journal.isi.ac.id/index.php/joged/article/download/14162/3921"}, {"title": "ejournal.unuja.ac.id", "url": "https://ejournal.unuja.ac.id/index.php/mushaf/article/download/7066/pdf"}, {"title": "mengenal padepokan anti galau cirebon tempat caleg stres cari ketenangan", "url": "https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/2024/04/25/mengenal-padepokan-anti-galau-cirebon-tempat-caleg-stres-cari-ketenangan"}, {"title": "best seller", "url": "https://www.gramedia.com/best-seller/?p=17668"}, {"title": "Membangun Kesadaran Quarter Life Crisis di Kalangan Mahasiswa Bojonegoro lewat Diskusi Literasi Ormada 2025", "url": "https://www.goodnewsfromindonesia.id/cerita-dari-kawan/komunitas/membangun-kesadaran-quarter-life-crisis-di-kalangan-mahasiswa-bojonegoro-melalui-diskusi-literasi-ormada-2025"}]}, "The search didn't turn up a definition of \"andilau.\" None of the results use the word, so it may be a typo, slang, or a regional term I can't confirm.\n\nThe results do explain the two words you asked about:\n\n- **Dilema** means being stuck choosing between two options that are both unappealing or impractical. One source describes it as a situation where a problem offers two possibilities, and neither is practical to accept. It can arise in romance, family, friendships, or other areas of life.\n- **Galau** is a broader feeling. It describes restless, mixed-up emotions, and one source notes it is often used to express a feeling of uncertainty, dilemma, or sadness. It is youth slang for a complex emotional state: confused, sad, restless, and emotionally uncertain.\n\nSo the usual distinction is that dilema is a specific choice between two options, while galau is the wider emotional state that can come with it. If you meant a different word, or can share where you saw \"andilau,\" I can search again."], "durationSeconds": 5.3184594170000015, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_016firpFq7u