{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01ExFKNm7afR7FkLyDXhJHjr", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://id.wiktionary.org/wiki/Lampiran:Bahasa_gaul_dalam_bahasa_Indonesia\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.liputan6.com/feeds/read/5955374/kata-gaul-populer-di-indonesiaini-istilah-kekiniannya\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kbbi.web.id/andilau\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kamusgaulkeren.blogspot.com/2017/06/penjelasan-tentang-arti-kata-gaul_505.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.pondokjeruk.com/2017/10/daftar-singkatan-gaul-dan-istilah-gaul.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bahasa_Indonesia_gaul\"}, {\"url\": \"https://id.wiktionary.org/wiki/andilau\"}, {\"url\": \"https://typoonline.com/kbbi/andilau\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.yayaazura.com/2022/08/50-contoh-bahasa-gaul-di-indonesia.html?m=1\"}, {\"url\": \"https://jagokata.com/arti-kata/andilau.html\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:17:57.074Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "andilau singkatan bahasa gaul artinya", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01VnT8NbLfr67Eoi5JwY2njL", "content": [{"title": "Lampiran:Bahasa gaul dalam bahasa Indonesia - Wikikamus bahasa Indonesia", "url": "https://id.wiktionary.org/wiki/Lampiran:Bahasa_gaul_dalam_bahasa_Indonesia"}, {"title": "Kata Gaul Populer di Indonesia,Ini Istilah Kekiniannya", "url": "https://www.liputan6.com/feeds/read/5955374/kata-gaul-populer-di-indonesiaini-istilah-kekiniannya"}, {"title": "Arti kata andilau - Kamus Besar Bahasa Indonesia (KBBI) Online", "url": "https://kbbi.web.id/andilau"}, {"title": "Penjelasan tentang Arti Kata Gaul \"Andilau\"", "url": "https://kamusgaulkeren.blogspot.com/2017/06/penjelasan-tentang-arti-kata-gaul_505.html"}, {"title": "Daftar Singkatan Gaul dan Istilah Gaul Komplit", "url": "https://www.pondokjeruk.com/2017/10/daftar-singkatan-gaul-dan-istilah-gaul.html"}, {"title": "Bahasa Indonesia gaul - Wikipedia bahasa Indonesia, ensiklopedia bebas", "url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bahasa_Indonesia_gaul"}, {"title": "andilau - Wikikamus bahasa Indonesia", "url": "https://id.wiktionary.org/wiki/andilau"}, {"title": "Arti kata andilau - Kamus Besar Bahasa Indonesia (KBBI) Online", "url": "https://typoonline.com/kbbi/andilau"}, {"title": "50 Contoh Bahasa Gaul Di Indonesia", "url": "https://www.yayaazura.com/2022/08/50-contoh-bahasa-gaul-di-indonesia.html?m=1"}, {"title": "Arti kata andilau. Semua maksud kata dari KBBI. andilau adalah...", "url": "https://jagokata.com/arti-kata/andilau.html"}]}, "\"Andilau\" is a slang abbreviation for **\"antara dilema dan galau\"** (roughly \"somewhere between dilemma and anguish\"). Several sources give this meaning.\n\n- One slang dictionary blog treats it as shorthand for that phrase, and its example sentence uses it to describe someone looking torn and gloomy. Andilau adalah singkatan dari antara dilema dan galau.\n- A list of adult-themed slang also gives ANDILAU = Antara Dilema dan GaLau.\n- Liputan6's list of current slang gives the sense as Andilau: Antara dilema dan galau.\n- The Wiktionary slang appendix describes its usage as a term meaning that things are hampir nggak ada bedanya, mirip-mirip, beda dikit banget, which means \"almost no difference\" or \"very similar.\"\n\nThe formal dictionary KBBI lists \"andilau\" only as an unrelated noun, a tall tree used for reforestation. Its entry does not cover the slang meaning. Definisi/arti kata 'andilau' di Kamus Besar Bahasa Indonesia (KBBI) adalah Mk n pohon tinggi."], "durationSeconds": 5.777056500000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01ExFKNm7afR7FkLyDXhJHjr", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
