{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgERRrpztxSMfEtW97SqM", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "\"Andilau\" 在印尼语俚语（bahasa gaul）里是 **\"antara dilema dan galau\"** 的缩写，意思是\"在两难和郁闷之间\"，指人纠结、拿不定主意、心里烦乱的状态。一共搜了 3 次。\n\n- 有三个网页给出了这个解释：一个俚语词典博客、一个网络缩写列表，还有 Liputan6 的流行俚语盘点。\n- 正式词典 KBBI 也收了 \"andilau\"，但只有一个无关的名词义项：一种高大的乔木，用于造林。\n- 有一份搜索摘要说，Wikikamus 的俚语附录把它解释为\"几乎没区别、差不多\"。这个说法和上面三个来源都不一致，可能是摘要搞错了，我没有去核实。\n\n依据网址：\n- [kamusgaulkeren.blogspot.com：Penjelasan tentang Arti Kata Gaul \"Andilau\"](https://kamusgaulkeren.blogspot.com/2017/06/penjelasan-tentang-arti-kata-gaul_505.html)\n- [Liputan6：Kata Gaul Populer di Indonesia](https://www.liputan6.com/feeds/read/5955374/kata-gaul-populer-di-indonesiaini-istilah-kekiniannya)\n- [pondokjeruk.com：Daftar Singkatan Gaul dan Istilah Gaul Komplit](https://www.pondokjeruk.com/2017/10/daftar-singkatan-gaul-dan-istilah-gaul.html)\n- [KBBI Online：andilau](https://kbbi.web.id/andilau)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1316, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6432, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1316}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:18:04.422Z", "request_id": "req_011CgERRrXezZREjfaMsReHZ"}
